						<tr>
							<th scope="row">Administration</th>
							<td>
								Coordinate workspace, access credentials,
								building information and required equipment.
							</td>
						</tr>

						<tr>
							<th scope="row">New employee</th>
							<td>
								Complete required forms, attend orientation
								and raise questions when instructions are
